{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A group of little kittens has secretly hidden inside the paintings, waiting for you to discover them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will search for the kittens hiding in various places within the painting of *Dream of the Red Chamber*. They might be hiding behind pavilions and towers, among artificial hills and flowers, or perhaps mimicking the amusing poses of the characters in the painting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's scenes are faithfully recreated from the classic silk album paintings by the Qing Dynasty artist Sun Wen. A passionate folk admirer of the epic, Sun Wen dedicated half his life to creating this masterpiece, visually interpreting the main storylines of the timeless literary classic, &quot;A Dream of Red Mansions.&quot; It is the perfect visual gateway into this legendary world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4142620?t=1764130549","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4142620?t=1764130549","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142620/5d95900b52b4431cd8e25bd2ebbeff7884c8196f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764130549","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142620/5d95900b52b4431cd8e25bd2ebbeff7884c8196f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764130549","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A group of little kittens has secretly hidden inside the paintings, waiting for you to discover them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will search for the kittens hiding in various places within the painting of *Dream of the Red Chamber*. They might be hiding behind pavilions and towers, among artificial hills and flowers, or perhaps mimicking the amusing poses of the characters in the painting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's scenes are faithfully recreated from the classic silk album paintings by the Qing Dynasty artist Sun Wen. A passionate folk admirer of the epic, Sun Wen dedicated half his life to creating this masterpiece, visually interpreting the main storylines of the timeless literary classic, &quot;A Dream of Red Mansions.&quot; It is the perfect visual gateway into this legendary world.</p>","developers":["HiddenCatGame"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142620/a8f614f8fc9f8246286f3d004bdab8a31db07249/header.jpg?t=1764130549","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4142620/2125147445/e6b9570fbe02d69a1fa9c3cb332e4c4cb2017a09/1762424791/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763478350","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4142620/2125147445/e6b9570fbe02d69a1fa9c3cb332e4c4cb2017a09/1762424791/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763478350","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4142620/2125147445/e6b9570fbe02d69a1fa9c3cb332e4c4cb2017a09/1762424791/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763478350","id":257227516,"name":"001","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257227516/6fe667dfd613d07a250677bcd77e43fd809cefe7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763478350"}],"name":"Cats in Paint","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 400 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> unknown<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["HiddenCatGame"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":